{"server":"tw","storyId":"story_deepcl_set_2_story_1","groupId":"story_deepcl_set_2","stageId":null,"title":"藍調","storyCode":null,"avgTag":"幕間","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_deepcl_2_1.txt","sourceHash":"7f647e832c269c655df4c74be33e4f5704a341169f94b7b8909367ef36558644","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"narration","text":"滴答，滴答……\n畫畫，畫畫……\n滴答，滴答……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_room_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島信使","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"您好，有您的信件！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深海色","speakerId":"avg_110_deepcl_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深海色","speakerId":"avg_110_deepcl_1","isRemote":false,"text":"放在門口就好，謝謝。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島信使","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"好的！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深海色","speakerId":"avg_110_deepcl_1","isRemote":false,"text":"剛剛想好怎麼下筆，這下子全忘了……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深海色","speakerId":"avg_110_deepcl_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深海色","speakerId":"avg_110_deepcl_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不管了，等一下再想吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深海色","speakerId":"avg_110_deepcl_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先去看看送來的是什麼東西。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深海色","speakerId":"avg_110_deepcl_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一幅畫？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深海色","speakerId":"avg_110_deepcl_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可我只會畫畫，不會買畫，到底是誰寄來的……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深海色","speakerId":"avg_110_deepcl_1","isRemote":false,"text":"奇怪，收件人和寄件人都沒寫名字。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"但深海色很明白，這幅畫就是寄給她的。\n無論是用色，還是筆觸，都讓她感到熟悉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深海色","speakerId":"avg_110_deepcl_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然不知道是誰寄來的，但謝謝你的禮物。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"於是，深海色將它放在了畫架旁，隨後重新開始了自己的創作。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_room_2"},{"type":"narration","text":"過了許久，一幅畫作完成，但那不是深海色所想的畫，而是“那幅畫”的臨摹。\n她的注意力不斷被那奇異的熟悉感吸走，這讓她的眼睛不由自主離開畫布，讓她的思維不斷臨摹畫框裡的色彩，讓她——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深海色","speakerId":"avg_110_deepcl_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深海色","speakerId":"avg_110_deepcl_1","isRemote":false,"text":"或許我該休息一下了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深海色","speakerId":"avg_110_deepcl_1","isRemote":false,"text":"今天也太熱鬧了……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深海色","speakerId":"avg_110_deepcl_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你怎麼來了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“輔助幹員”","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"來看你畫畫，今天有新畫嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深海色","speakerId":"avg_110_deepcl_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還沒有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“輔助幹員”","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"但畫布上不是已經畫了一些東西了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“輔助幹員”","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"一條小溪，一片樹林，一座木屋？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深海色","speakerId":"avg_110_deepcl_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那是臨摹的，有人送給了我一幅畫，我的腦袋裡都是它，下筆也只能臨摹它。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“輔助幹員”","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"臨摹也是畫啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深海色","speakerId":"avg_110_deepcl_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那是複製別人的思想與技法，只能算是練習，不能說是我的畫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“輔助幹員”","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"對我來說沒什麼區別，只要是用你的手拿著畫筆蘸著顏料塗出來的資訊，我都喜歡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深海色","speakerId":"avg_110_deepcl_1","isRemote":false,"text":"總之，今天不畫了，走吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深海色","speakerId":"avg_110_deepcl_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼了？你怎麼也在看那幅畫？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“輔助幹員”","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"我覺得……好熟悉……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“輔助幹員”","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"你不這麼覺得嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深海色","speakerId":"avg_110_deepcl_1","isRemote":false,"text":"因為這份親切感我已經一筆都畫不下去了，你要是喜歡的話，就把它帶回去吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“輔助幹員”","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"但你已經見過它了，我帶走它是沒用的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深海色","speakerId":"avg_110_deepcl_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也是……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深海色","speakerId":"avg_110_deepcl_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那我們該怎麼辦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“輔助幹員”","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"去調查？去探險？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深海色","speakerId":"avg_110_deepcl_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好像也沒有別的辦法了……就聽你的吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“輔助幹員”","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"好的，我們現在就出發！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深海色","speakerId":"avg_110_deepcl_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等、等等！你不準備一下嗎？至少帶上這幅畫！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_corridor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島信使","speakerId":"avg_npc_972_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你問我這個包裹是哪裡來的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深海色","speakerId":"avg_110_deepcl_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，上面既沒有寫收件人也沒有寫寄件人，但這確實是我的包裹，所以我想詢問一下，它是從哪裡寄過來的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深海色","speakerId":"avg_110_deepcl_1","isRemote":false,"text":"總不能是突然——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島信使","speakerId":"avg_npc_972_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對不起，我確實沒有印象收到過這份郵包。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深海色","speakerId":"avg_110_deepcl_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島信使","speakerId":"avg_npc_972_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我從外面回來，檢查的時候沒有看到過這個包裹，你確定是我送的嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島信使","speakerId":"avg_npc_972_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過你別擔心，我現在就去查，一定能給你一個答覆的，說不定是人事那邊的反詐騙演習呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島信使","speakerId":"avg_npc_972_1","isRemote":false,"text":"請稍等一下，我馬上回來！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深海色","speakerId":"avg_110_deepcl_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你跑到哪裡去了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深海色","speakerId":"avg_110_deepcl_1","isRemote":false,"text":"剛剛給我送包裹的信使先生說沒有印象……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“輔助幹員”","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"我問了我的朋友，它們知道這幅畫是從哪裡來的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深海色","speakerId":"avg_110_deepcl_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是哪裡來的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“輔助幹員”","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"順著河流一直走，一直走，就能看到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“輔助幹員”","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"一條小溪，一片樹林，一座木屋。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深海色","speakerId":"avg_110_deepcl_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別開玩笑了，大地上有這麼多溪流，我怎麼知道是哪一條啊……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“輔助幹員”","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"朋友們把位置告訴我了，我來為你帶路。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深海色","speakerId":"avg_110_deepcl_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好吧，你先在這裡等我一下……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“輔助幹員”","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"你去哪裡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深海色","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我去拿畫筆和畫布。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_outcounty"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深海色","speakerId":"avg_110_deepcl_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，先停一下！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“輔助幹員”","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深海色","speakerId":"avg_110_deepcl_1","isRemote":false,"text":"讓我休息一會……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“輔助幹員”","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"好的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深海色","speakerId":"avg_110_deepcl_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們走了多久？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“輔助幹員”","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"幾天？幾週？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“輔助幹員”","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"你累了嗎，需要我幫你背畫畫工具嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深海色","speakerId":"avg_110_deepcl_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不用，我是畫家，這我還背得動……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深海色","speakerId":"avg_110_deepcl_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼了，你也想畫畫？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“輔助幹員”","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"我想，但我不會，學也學不會。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深海色","speakerId":"avg_110_deepcl_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那就幫我準備顏料吧，反正都休息了，我想畫一會畫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“輔助幹員”","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"好的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_outcounty"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深海色","speakerId":"avg_110_deepcl_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還是不行嗎……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"即使看著眼前截然不同的景色，但在深海色筆下畫出的，仍是那幅畫中的場景。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“輔助幹員”","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"現在這幅畫不好嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深海色","speakerId":"avg_110_deepcl_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然木屋還沒畫，但……太奇怪了……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深海色","speakerId":"avg_110_deepcl_1","isRemote":false,"text":"明明顏料都不一樣，為什麼最後還是會畫得分毫不差？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“輔助幹員”","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"你還在臨摹嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深海色","speakerId":"avg_110_deepcl_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，是啊……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“輔助幹員”","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"畫自然景色畫得逼真也叫作臨摹嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深海色","speakerId":"avg_110_deepcl_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那叫擬真。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“輔助幹員”","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"不一樣嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深海色","speakerId":"avg_110_deepcl_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，不一樣的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“輔助幹員”","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"那我覺得，你應該要說自己是在擬真而不是在臨摹。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深海色","speakerId":"avg_110_deepcl_1","isRemote":false,"text":"能不能別混淆概念了……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“輔助幹員”","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"你看看前面。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"越過畫布，深海色突然發現，眼前被畫布擋住的景色，正是自己筆下剛繪製出的那一方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深海色","speakerId":"avg_110_deepcl_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這，怎麼回事？我們眼前不應該是草地嗎？哪裡來的溪流？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“輔助幹員”","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"你畫得真好，和自然一模一樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“輔助幹員”","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"順著這條小溪走下去，我們會不會就到目的地了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深海色","speakerId":"avg_110_deepcl_1","isRemote":false,"text":"或許吧……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深海色","speakerId":"avg_110_deepcl_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，真是越來越奇怪了……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深海色","speakerId":"avg_110_deepcl_1","isRemote":false,"text":"幫我收一下畫架好嗎，助手？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“輔助幹員”","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"好的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_forest"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深海色","speakerId":"avg_110_deepcl_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“輔助幹員”","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"你在疑惑什麼，深海色？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深海色","speakerId":"avg_110_deepcl_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我覺得……很熟悉……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“輔助幹員”","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"還是那幅畫嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深海色","speakerId":"avg_110_deepcl_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是這個地方，這片森林，這條小溪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深海色","speakerId":"avg_110_deepcl_1","isRemote":false,"text":"畫裡畫的就是這個地方……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“輔助幹員”","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"我看到前面的小屋了，木製的，就是畫裡的那一座。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深海色","speakerId":"avg_110_deepcl_1","isRemote":false,"text":"終於到了……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_forest"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深海色","speakerId":"avg_110_deepcl_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就是這裡嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“輔助幹員”","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"從我這個角度看，是一樣的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深海色","speakerId":"avg_110_deepcl_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那我們進去吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“輔助幹員”","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，我在門口等你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深海色","speakerId":"avg_110_deepcl_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不想進去看看嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“輔助幹員”","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"我進不去，我看不見門。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深海色","speakerId":"avg_110_deepcl_1","isRemote":false,"text":"門就在這裡，你看，我把它打開了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“輔助幹員”","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"我還是什麼都沒看見，對不起。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“輔助幹員”","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"你去吧，我在這裡等你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深海色","speakerId":"avg_110_deepcl_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那，你等我一下，我馬上回來。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_towerinside"},{"type":"narration","text":"這屋子已經很久沒有人住了，傢俱破敗不堪，畫作四處散落，所有東西都蒙上了厚厚一層灰。\n隨之而來的，是如影隨形的熟悉感，沒有那幅畫上的那麼詭異，取而代之的，是親切與眷戀。\n就像是……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深海色","speakerId":"avg_110_deepcl_1","isRemote":false,"text":"家？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"深海色隨手拿起一幅畫，抹去灰塵，露出殘破的真相。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"當繪畫成為生命，生活便墮落為毒藥。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_110_deepcl_1","isRemote":false,"text":"除了順流而下，再無選擇。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深海色","speakerId":"avg_110_deepcl_1","isRemote":false,"text":"樹林、溪流、木屋……怎麼都是一模一樣的畫？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"深海色取下一幅牆上的掛畫，吹開枷鎖，往事猛然掙脫。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_110_deepcl_1","isRemote":false,"text":"聽說遠方有著為繪匠而備的天堂……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_110_deepcl_1","isRemote":false,"text":"從此順流而下，便能抵達。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深海色","speakerId":"avg_110_deepcl_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳……這個橢圓畫框不是肖像畫才用的嗎？怎麼還是它？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深海色","speakerId":"avg_110_deepcl_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不會連素描本裡也……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"深海色翻開桌上的素描本，紙張顫動，傳達出陳舊的警示。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_110_deepcl_1","isRemote":false,"text":"畫不出美的手，未見過美的心，未抵天堂，自毀近在咫尺。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_110_deepcl_1","isRemote":false,"text":"順流……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深海色","speakerId":"avg_110_deepcl_1","isRemote":false,"text":"果然……每一頁都只有屋外的景色。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深海色","speakerId":"avg_110_deepcl_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這座屋子的主人，大概是瘋了吧……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深海色","speakerId":"avg_110_deepcl_1","isRemote":false,"text":"既然她畫了這麼多，那這一幅，也留給她好了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"畫落在脫毛的地毯上，發出一聲悶響。\n它將在這裡被遺忘，被塵埃淹沒。\n直到……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_110_deepcl_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她畫下的最後一幅畫，成為永恆。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_forest"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“輔助幹員”","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"你回來了，有什麼發現嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深海色","speakerId":"avg_110_deepcl_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“輔助幹員”","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"那幅畫呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深海色","speakerId":"avg_110_deepcl_1","isRemote":false,"text":"丟在屋子裡了，我不想再記起它了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“輔助幹員”","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼，你能畫畫了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深海色","speakerId":"avg_110_deepcl_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在這裡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“輔助幹員”","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深海色","speakerId":"avg_110_deepcl_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那不還是只能畫出同樣的場景？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“輔助幹員”","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"不試試看怎麼知道呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深海色","speakerId":"avg_110_deepcl_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯……也對，我試試看。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_forest"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深海色","speakerId":"avg_110_deepcl_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“輔助幹員”","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"這不是同一幅畫嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深海色","speakerId":"avg_110_deepcl_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不一樣的，你看，這裡的光線和角度，還有用色的方法都和那幅畫有區別。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深海色","speakerId":"avg_110_deepcl_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深海色","speakerId":"avg_110_deepcl_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好像，缺了些什麼……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深海色","speakerId":"avg_110_deepcl_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不是技巧上的問題……奇怪……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“輔助幹員”","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深海色","speakerId":"avg_110_deepcl_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……你之前說，你的朋友告訴你畫從這裡來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“輔助幹員”","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，有什麼問題嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深海色","speakerId":"avg_110_deepcl_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的朋友，能夠走進屋子嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“輔助幹員”","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"它們做不到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深海色","speakerId":"avg_110_deepcl_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那它們怎麼能知道畫的所在……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“輔助幹員”","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"“順流而下，在溪流的盡頭。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“輔助幹員”","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"它們是這樣說的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深海色","speakerId":"avg_110_deepcl_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深海色","speakerId":"avg_110_deepcl_1","isRemote":false,"text":"溪流的盡頭有什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“輔助幹員”","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"有屋子的主人想要的東西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深海色","speakerId":"avg_110_deepcl_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哼……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深海色","speakerId":"avg_110_deepcl_1","isRemote":false,"text":"助手，這幅畫你先幫我收起來吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“輔助幹員”","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"好的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深海色","speakerId":"avg_110_deepcl_1","isRemote":false,"text":"然後，我們可以沿著溪流走下去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深海色","speakerId":"avg_110_deepcl_1","isRemote":false,"text":"溪流的盡頭究竟有什麼呢？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"32_RL2_cliffday"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深海色","speakerId":"avg_110_deepcl_1","isRemote":false,"text":"助手，還有水嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“助祭”","speakerId":"avg_npc_454_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只有眼前的海水了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深海色","speakerId":"avg_110_deepcl_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好餓……好累……沒人想來這裡畫畫吧……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“助祭”","speakerId":"avg_npc_454_1","isRemote":false,"text":"畫畫？當然不是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“助祭”","speakerId":"avg_npc_454_1","isRemote":false,"text":"來這裡是為了活下去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“助祭”","speakerId":"avg_npc_454_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你看。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"順著助手所指的方向看去，能看到一堆雜亂的繪畫工具。\n顏料早已乾涸，木製畫架碎落一地。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深海色","speakerId":"avg_110_deepcl_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真可憐……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“助祭”","speakerId":"avg_npc_454_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別的地方已經沒有她的容身之所了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“助祭”","speakerId":"avg_npc_454_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而生存，是容不下雜質的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“助祭”","speakerId":"avg_npc_454_1","isRemote":false,"text":"為了活下去，就得拋棄一切。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"在一堆礁石中，深海色看到了一個熟悉的畫框。\n支離破碎，瀕臨死亡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深海色","speakerId":"avg_110_deepcl_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這就是包裹裡的那幅畫……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“助祭”","speakerId":"avg_npc_454_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深海色","speakerId":"avg_110_deepcl_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她想要把畫送給我……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“助祭”","speakerId":"avg_npc_454_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深海色","speakerId":"avg_110_deepcl_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而我把它丟回了屋子裡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“助祭”","speakerId":"avg_npc_454_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，畢竟你已經不需要它了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深海色","speakerId":"avg_110_deepcl_1","isRemote":false,"text":"或許我該……留個紀念？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“助祭”","speakerId":"avg_npc_454_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那我們可以把你的臨摹寄回去，怎麼樣？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深海色","speakerId":"avg_110_deepcl_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就這樣做吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“助祭”","speakerId":"avg_npc_454_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那我們呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深海色","speakerId":"avg_110_deepcl_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們繼續前進。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“助祭”","speakerId":"avg_npc_454_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡已經是盡頭了，你要去哪裡？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"深海色踏入了海洋。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深海色","speakerId":"avg_110_deepcl_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她被海洋帶走了，不是嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“助祭”","speakerId":"avg_npc_454_1","isRemote":false,"text":"被海洋浸濕，就再也回不去了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深海色","speakerId":"avg_110_deepcl_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她有得選嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“助祭”","speakerId":"avg_npc_454_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深海色","speakerId":"avg_110_deepcl_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那我想，我也沒有，對嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深海色","speakerId":"avg_110_deepcl_1","isRemote":false,"text":"走吧，助手，做事得有始有終。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"51_g12_seabed"},{"type":"narration","text":"灌滿海洋的不是水。\n是墨，是油，是色彩。\n它浸潤了深海色的每一根神經，刷去了她心中所有的情感。\n她變得純粹，變得完美。\n許多聲音同她一起鳴唱，呼喊著生存的和諧。\n她湊上前去，想要應和那聲音。\n但她沒唱，她拿起了筆。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"鳴唱戛然而止。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“助手”","speakerId":"avg_npc_457_1","isRemote":false,"text":"生存的表達不應是這樣的，深海色。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深海色","speakerId":"avg_110_deepcl_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我還活著，我想要畫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“助手”","speakerId":"avg_npc_457_1","isRemote":false,"text":"繪畫沒有防衛效果，繪畫不能補充營養，這是種錯誤的生存邏輯！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深海色","speakerId":"avg_110_deepcl_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，但畫畫就是活著，我怎麼能不畫呢？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"筆尖沾著海墨，色彩在水中飛舞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“助手”","speakerId":"avg_npc_457_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你忘記自己擁抱海洋的初衷了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深海色","speakerId":"avg_110_deepcl_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我當然記得，為了生存拋棄繪畫，在那苦恨中走向末路。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深海色","speakerId":"avg_110_deepcl_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以她溺死了，我還活著，我要表達。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深海色","speakerId":"avg_110_deepcl_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不再拋棄色彩，不再捨離紙筆，我再也不願停下了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深海色","speakerId":"avg_110_deepcl_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一起來畫吧，助手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“助手”","speakerId":"avg_npc_457_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們應當積蓄能量，克服弱點，力求進化。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深海色","speakerId":"avg_110_deepcl_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，我們能夠在繪畫上更進一步。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“助手”","speakerId":"avg_npc_457_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那是進化的謬誤。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深海色","speakerId":"avg_110_deepcl_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就算是吧，那又怎麼樣呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深海色","speakerId":"avg_110_deepcl_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不會，也不想聽從大群的呼喚。我將僅剩的自我全留給繪畫。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"隨著她的筆，她的塗抹，她的表達，海底逐漸鋪滿了色彩。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"51_g13_seabornnest"},{"type":"narration","text":"即使是海水，都抵擋不住這股宣洩。\n海水與油墨混合散開，不久後又攪到一起，循環往復，終究還是在這海洋中留下了烙印。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深海色","speakerId":"avg_110_deepcl_1","isRemote":false,"text":"快來，助手，我一個人忙不過來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深海色","speakerId":"avg_110_deepcl_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別讓色塊散開，把它聚攏到我這裡來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深海色","speakerId":"avg_110_deepcl_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你說什麼？那些同胞走遠了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深海色","speakerId":"avg_110_deepcl_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那是它們的大群，和我們，和我又有什麼關係？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深海色","speakerId":"avg_110_deepcl_1","isRemote":false,"text":"調色完成了嗎？海洋還等著我們為它染上色彩呢！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深海色","speakerId":"avg_110_deepcl_1","isRemote":false,"text":"助手，你還在嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深海色","speakerId":"avg_110_deepcl_1","isRemote":false,"text":"助手？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_room_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深海色","speakerId":"avg_110_deepcl_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼，就畫到這裡吧……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"深海色面前的畫布上，數個藍色色塊組成了畫面的主體。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深海色","speakerId":"avg_110_deepcl_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是關於我們的故事，不過最後的處理是不是太過激烈了？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"調色盤中伸展而出的細長腕足左右搖晃著，也不知道是在肯定還是在否定。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深海色","speakerId":"avg_110_deepcl_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可能是因為海嗣的生活實在太壓抑了，用些激進的表達方式來抗議那段生活，應該也無可厚非吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深海色","speakerId":"avg_110_deepcl_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那這幅畫就結束了。我得把它蓋好再處理一下，不然周邊的幹員再來投訴，人事部的人真的會把我從船上趕下去的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深海色","speakerId":"avg_110_deepcl_1","isRemote":false,"text":"難得有一個不受那些傢伙騷擾，能夠安心畫畫的地方。我可不想再東躲西藏了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島信使","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"您好，有您的信件！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深海色","speakerId":"avg_110_deepcl_1","isRemote":false,"text":"來了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島信使","speakerId":"avg_npc_972_1","isRemote":false,"text":"深海色幹員對吧，這是您訂的東西，一些繪畫耗材和一個畫框。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深海色","speakerId":"avg_110_deepcl_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，謝謝你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島信使","speakerId":"avg_npc_972_1","isRemote":false,"text":"請先確認一下，無誤的話請在這裡簽個名。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深海色","speakerId":"avg_110_deepcl_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是這裡嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島信使","speakerId":"avg_npc_972_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深海色","speakerId":"avg_110_deepcl_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好……完成！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島信使","speakerId":"avg_npc_972_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我還以為您的字也會是藍色的呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深海色","speakerId":"avg_110_deepcl_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島信使","speakerId":"avg_npc_972_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那祝您今天生活愉快！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深海色","speakerId":"avg_110_deepcl_1","isRemote":false,"text":"謝謝！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深海色","speakerId":"avg_110_deepcl_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿咻。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深海色","speakerId":"avg_110_deepcl_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼，下一幅畫什麼好呢？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
